TESTBRAM_X2Y1.RAMB18_Y1.INIT_01[255:0] = 256'b1100110011001100110011001100110011001100110011001100110011001100110011001100110011001100110011001100110011001100110011001100110011001100110011001100110011001100110011001100110011001100110011001100110011001100110011001100110011001100110011001100110011001100
